  {
    "id": 2007014010230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『あーんごめん急に電話して！\r\nうち寄る前にさ、ホットアイマスク買ってくれない？』",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『……うん、そう！　いつも使ってるやつ！\r\n……助かる～！　あれ使うと安眠度合いが違うんだよねぇ』",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『んふふ、じゃあ待ってるから！　──違うって、\r\nアイマスクだけじゃなくてそっちのことも♡』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『忘れちゃった？\r\n今日は頑張ってご飯作るって言ったじゃん』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『おつかいの分と……毎日たーくさん頑張ってる分\r\n絶品──ではないかもだけど、三峰のご飯で労ったげる』",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『そういうことだから、おつかい後は寄り道なしで\r\n来てよねー？　……ふふ、またあとで！』",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010280"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
