    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010400,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んー……\r\nやっぱり、その人っぽい内容の、かな",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010400"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010410,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "生身でもキャラクターでも\r\nこういう企画って結構あるじゃん？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010410"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010420,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "二次元三次元問わず、\r\n推しが関わってる企画は何度も見てきたけど",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010420"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010430,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『これほんとに言うかなー？』みたいな台詞言わされてると\r\n申し訳なくなったよね……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010430"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー……企画の趣旨を優先しすぎて、\r\nあまりにも本人なら言わない台詞が出てくると",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010440,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そ！\r\n萎えるってか冷めるってか、まぁ、うん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010440"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010450,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──ということで",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010450"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010460,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "普段の三峰っぽいんじゃない？　のテイストで\r\n先方のオーダーにそってみました！　ご確認ください！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010460"
  },
