  {
    "id": 2007014010470,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『もしもーし、こちらお客様の彼女の結華でーす\r\nお疲れな気配を察知したので、お電話差し上げました』",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010470"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010480,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『──なんで知ってるのかって～？　それは企業秘密♡\r\nそんなことよりほら、よく聞いて？』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010480"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010490,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『毎日やらなきゃいけないことと戦ってて\r\nめちゃめちゃ偉い！　すっごーく頑張ってる！』",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010490"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010500,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『……うん？　誰かに褒めてもらいたいタイミングかなって\r\nそれは私の仕事でしょ？』",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010500"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "『アンティーカさん\r\nそろそろスタンバイお願いしまーす！』",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0112"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010510,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『──ああごめんもう休憩終わる……！\r\nまた電話するから、今はこれで何卒……！』",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701401/2007014010510"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007014010520,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『もっとちゃんと話聞くし、なんなら会いに行くからさ\r\nまたあとで。大好きだよ！』",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
